OL,3,AFlights grounded in Belgium due to
OL,4,Astrike against austerity measures
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe protest comes as Prime Minister
OL,7,FBart De Wever has so far failed to
OL,8,Fagree a budget to cut costs with his
OL,9,Fcoalition allies. King Philippe
OL,10,Fdeclined his resignation earlier this
OL,11,Fmonth, giving De Wever more time to
OL,12,Fnegotiate.
OL,23,APub: 23-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
